diff --git a/HISTORY.md b/HISTORY.md
index bcc8f04..0c0167f 100644
--- a/HISTORY.md
+++ b/HISTORY.md
@@ -26,6 +26,20 @@ Our backwards-compatibility policy can be found [here](https://github.com/python
   ([#732](https://github.com/python-attrs/cattrs/pull/732))
 - Support running the test suite without `cbor2` installed.
   ([#748](https://github.com/python-attrs/cattrs/pull/748))
+- Fix a number of latent bugs:
+  hook factory decorators now return the decorated factory;
+  `Converter.copy()` keeps fallback factories and union structure hooks;
+  generated hooks handle renamed keys and TypedDict keys containing quotes or backslashes, and class names that aren't identifiers;
+  `Counter` keys are unstructured;
+  NamedTuples with stringified annotations (and their subclasses) are handled;
+  `Annotated` overrides on dataclasses with stringified annotations are honored;
+  typed enums with stringified annotations are structured correctly;
+  union disambiguation handles enum literals and dataclass `default_factory` fields;
+  `configure_tagged_union` with a default no longer grows its tag mapping on unknown tags;
+  the _orjson_ converter unstructures bare enum mapping keys to their values;
+  the _msgspec_ converter respects custom hooks on dataclass fields, `omit_if_default`, `use_alias`, `init=False` and `Annotated` overrides;
+  error formatting no longer crashes on non-string extra keys or argument-less exceptions;
+  `cattrs.subclasses.subclasses` no longer drops non-slotted subclasses of slotted dataclasses.
 
 ## 26.1.0 (2026-02-18)
 
